# No computer-use UI verification

- **Never** verify UI using computer use (browser/desktop automation, screenshots via computer-use agents, or similar) unless the user explicitly asks for it in the current request.
- Do not launch `computerUse` / browser-driven visual QA as a default part of frontend work, testing, or PR verification.
- Prefer code review, existing automated tests, static inspection, or asking the user when UI confirmation would help.
- If the user later says to verify the UI with computer use, that request overrides this rule for that turn only.
